abstract: >-
  Reviewer and source repository for restricted-column theorems in the
  Hambardzumyan–Lovett–Shirley two-level formulation of the log-rank
  conjecture: a sharp hypergeometric two-point escape bound, logarithmic
  communication for interior Johnson products, and sparse Johnson-column
  protocols. These results do not prove the general log-rank conjecture.
